if {Varia.v_greet_talked} == false:
	varia: Hmm?
	varia (neutral_left): Oh.
	varia (smile_center): Hey there.
	varia (smile_left): What brings you here in [wave]Apocrypha[/wave]?
	- A calling.
		varia (neutral_center): Oh, you're just like that robot who went on board to this place as well.[n]Said that it seeked for an answer.
	- For fame.
		varia (smile_center): Interesting![n]Seems like we're much alike then.
		varia: I'm hoping to get some fame in this mission. [pause=0.5]Heh.
	- To discover new things.
		varia (smile_center): There's definitely plenty to discover here.
	varia (neutral_left): In any case...
	varia (smile_center): Good Luck in your journey!
else:
	varia: Hmm?
	varia (confused_left): Oh- [pause=0.2]Apologies for my manners.
	varia (confused_right): I completely forgot to introduce myself.
	varia (smile_center): The name is Varia. [pause=0.2]I am an adventurer like you.[input] Though I'm here more to protect y'all.
	varia (neutral_center): Section Commander from the Tri-sun district tasked me for this job.[input] Wonder which district you belong in.
	varia (smile_center): In any case, nice meeting you!
set {Varia.v_greet_talked} = true